msgctxt "031"
msgid ":Use \"/MODE %s -A %s\" to remove the password and then immediately set a new one.  IMPORTANT: YOU CANNOT RECOVER THIS PASSWORD, EVER; WRITE THE PASSWORD DOWN (don't store this rescue password on disk)! Now set the channel user password (+U)."
