#: ircd/s_err.c:109
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "032"
msgid ":WARNING: You removed the channel Admin password (+A). If you disconnect or leave the channel without setting a new password then you will not be able to set it again!  SET A NEW PASSWORD NOW!"
